URL:https://mae.princeton.edu/events/2026/local-maps-are-all-you-need
LOCATION:Bowen Hall 222
SUMMARY:Local Maps Are All You Need!
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Abstract:&nbsp\;In robotics\, we have spent a lot of time build
 ing really good maps from noisy sensor data. Who doesn’t like a nice\, c
 risp\, globally consistent map? Over the last 20 years\, I have been explo
 ring a paradigm to robot navigation that eschews such globally consistent 
 maps in favour of graphs of local maps\, which are cheaper to construct\, 
 store\, and query. These topometric maps enable so-called teach-and-repeat
  (T&amp\;R) navigation. In this talk\, I will give a progress update on so
 me of the new things we are doing with T&amp\;R including using different 
 primary sensors\,
CATEGORIES:MAE Departmental Seminars
DTSTAMP:20260812T171816Z
